  <diagram name="Page-1" id="orSJwuuM3CSiPJs0jADv">
    <mxGraphModel dx="3879" dy="1753" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\ntitle Financial Management Module (SRS 3.2.13) - Roles Separated\n\nleft to right direction\n\nskinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam actorStyle awesome\nskinparam roundcorner 18\n\nskinparam packageStyle rectangle\nskinparam packageBackgroundColor #EAF2F8\nskinparam packageBorderColor #647F99\nskinparam packageFontColor #263B50\nskinparam packagePadding 16\nskinparam packageMargin 12\n\nskinparam defaultFontName Arial\nskinparam defaultFontSize 13\nskinparam nodesep 30\nskinparam ranksep 45\n\n&#39; أمر الخطوط الحادة (Sharp/Orthogonal Lines)\nskinparam linetype ortho\nskinparam ArrowThickness 1.4\n\nskinparam UseCaseBackgroundColor #FFFFFF\nskinparam UseCaseBorderColor #647F99\nskinparam UseCaseFontColor #263B50\n\nskinparam ActorBorderColor #334155\nskinparam ActorFontColor #263B50\n\n&#39; =========================\n&#39; Primary Actors (على الشمال)\n&#39; =========================\nactor \&quot;Authorized\\nFinance User\\n(Operations)\&quot; as Finance #DCEBFA\nactor \&quot;Finance Manager\\n(Reporting &amp; Control)\&quot; as FinManager #93C5FD\n\nrectangle \&quot;Financial Management Module\&quot; {\n\n    &#39; Column 1\n    together {\n        package \&quot;01 - Financial Documents (3.2.13.1)\&quot; as P1 {\n            usecase \&quot;Upload Financial Documents\&quot; as UC01\n            usecase \&quot;View Financial Documents\&quot; as UC03\n            usecase \&quot;Download Financial Documents\&quot; as UC04\n            \n            &#39; العمليات المضافة الخاصة بالـ Categories\n            usecase \&quot;Create Category\&quot; as UC02_Cat_Create\n            usecase \&quot;View Categories\&quot; as UC02_Cat_View\n            usecase \&quot;Update Category\&quot; as UC02_Cat_Update\n            usecase \&quot;Delete Category\&quot; as UC02_Cat_Delete\n\n            usecase \&quot;Check Duplication of\\nCategory Name\&quot; as UC02_Cat_Dup\n            usecase \&quot;Verify Category\\nIs Empty\&quot; as UC02_Cat_Empty\n        }\n\n        package \&quot;02 - Financial Records (3.2.13.2)\&quot; as P2 {\n            usecase \&quot;Record &amp; Manage\\nFunding\&quot; as UC05\n            usecase \&quot;Record &amp; Manage\\nRevenue\&quot; as UC06\n            usecase \&quot;Record &amp; Manage\\nExpenses\&quot; as UC07\n            usecase \&quot;Record &amp; Manage\\nBanking Transactions\&quot; as UC08\n        }\n    }\n\n    &#39; Column 2\n    together {\n        package \&quot;03 - Budget &amp; Reporting (3.2.13.3)\&quot; as P3 {\n            usecase \&quot;View Financial Summary\&quot; as UC09\n            usecase \&quot;View Total Revenue\&quot; as UC10\n            usecase \&quot;View Total Expenses\&quot; as UC11\n            usecase \&quot;View Total Funding\&quot; as UC12\n            \n            usecase \&quot;Review Uploaded\\nBudget Reports\&quot; as UC13\n            usecase \&quot;Compare Planned and\\nActual Values\&quot; as UC14\n        }\n\n        package \&quot;04 - Data Access Control (3.2.13.4)\&quot; as P4 {\n            usecase \&quot;View Product Costs\&quot; as UC15\n            usecase \&quot;View Profit Information\&quot; as UC16\n            usecase \&quot;View Approved Final\\nSelling Prices\&quot; as UC17\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n&#39; =========================\n&#39; Secondary Actor (على اليمين)\n&#39; =========================\nactor \&quot;Sales User\&quot; as Sales #FFEDD5\n\n&#39; =========================\n&#39; Layout Hints\n&#39; =========================\nFinance -[hidden]down-&gt; FinManager\nP1 -[hidden]right-&gt; P3\nUC04 -[hidden]down-&gt; UC05\nUC14 -[hidden]down-&gt; UC15\n\n&#39; =========================\n&#39; Finance User Associations (Daily Operations) - LIGHT BLUE\n&#39; =========================\nFinance -[#2563EB]-&gt; UC01\nFinance -[#2563EB]-&gt; UC03\nFinance -[#2563EB]-&gt; UC04\n\n&#39; ربط عمليات الـ Categories\nFinance -[#2563EB]-&gt; UC02_Cat_Create\nFinance -[#2563EB]-&gt; UC02_Cat_View\nFinance -[#2563EB]-&gt; UC02_Cat_Update\nFinance -[#2563EB]-&gt; UC02_Cat_Delete\n\n&#39; ربط السجلات المالية\nFinance -[#2563EB]-&gt; UC05\nFinance -[#2563EB]-&gt; UC06\nFinance -[#2563EB]-&gt; UC07\nFinance -[#2563EB]-&gt; UC08\n\n&#39; =========================\n&#39; Finance Manager Associations (Reporting &amp; Control) - DARK BLUE\n&#39; =========================\nFinManager -[#0284C7]-&gt; UC09\nFinManager -[#0284C7]-&gt; UC13\nFinManager -[#0284C7]-&gt; UC15\nFinManager -[#0284C7]-&gt; UC16\n\nFinManager -[#0284C7]-&gt; UC03\n&#39; =========================\n&#39; Sales User Associations - ORANGE (من اليمين لليسار)\n&#39; =========================\nUC17 &lt;-[#EA580C]- Sales\n\n&#39; =========================\n&#39; Relationships (Includes/Extends)\n&#39; =========================\n&#39; Category Validations Logic\nUC02_Cat_Create ..&gt; UC02_Cat_Dup : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC02_Cat_Update ..&gt; UC02_Cat_Dup : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC02_Cat_Delete ..&gt; UC02_Cat_Empty : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\n&#39; Financial Summary Logic\nUC09 ..&gt; UC10 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC09 ..&gt; UC11 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC09 ..&gt; UC12 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\n&#39; Budget Logic\nUC13 &lt;.. UC14 : &lt;&lt;extend&gt;&gt;\n\n&#39; =========================\n&#39; SRS Notes\n&#39; =========================\nnote bottom of P2\n  **SRS 3.2.13.2:** Each record shall include relevant \n  details such as amount, date, category, and description.\nend note\n\nnote bottom of P4\n  **SRS 3.2.13.4 Access Control:**\n- **Finance Manager:** Access to high-level reports, costs, and profit.\n- **Finance User:** Manages daily records and documents.\n- **Sales User:** Restricted strictly to viewing approved final prices.\nend note\n\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="ABBZJCCz67ZKBa7hlbdH-1">
